d 'VARATIO': module for calculating the k-group omnibus variance-ratio balance diagnostic
d
d  varatio reports a k-group omnibus summary of variance-ratio
d imbalance across levels of by(). Three omnibus statistics are
d reported together: (1) F_VR, a size-weighted quadratic
d combination of the pairwise log-variance-ratios (Linden, 2026),
d (2) GMVR, the geometric mean of the pairwise variance ratios,
d extended from two-groups (Linden and Samuels, 2013), and (3)
d max(VR*), the largest pairwise variance ratio, extended from
d two-groups for standardized mean differences (Lopez and Gutman,
d 2017). 
d
d KW: variance ratio
d KW: k-samples
d KW: weights
d
d Requires: Stata version 11
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260820
d
d Author: Ariel Linden, Linden Consulting Group, LLC
d Support: email alinden@@lindenconsulting.org
d
f varatio.ado
f varatio.sthlp
